# Daring Waverider {4}{U}{U}, 4/4: "When this creature enters, you may cast target instant or sorcery card with mana value 4 or less
# from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead." Faithless
# Looting on turn 1 discards Truck Toss (mana value 4, exactly at the limit) and Light of Judgment (5, just past it); Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt (1) is in Bot2's graveyard. On turn 3 the trigger refuses the Light of Judgment and the opponent's Bolt and takes
# Truck Toss, which deals 4 damage to Bot2 (20 to 16) for no mana (all six sources were spent on the Waverider), and is exiled
# instead of going to the graveyard.

